	(text "PWR_FLAGs: VPHY and VPLL are fed through ferrites (passive to ERC).\nU701 is a project copy of KiCad's FT232H with VCCD, EECS, EECLK typed\nas outputs.\nC709/C711 DNP: 4.7 uF pads per FTDI, fit if the PHY/PLL rails\nneed more bulk." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 254 147.32 0) (effects (font (size 1.016 1.016) (italic yes)) (justify left top)) (uuid "3c530e2b-8a30-5363-a5ad-964281a2d464"))
